Bundled FFmpeg
--------------

Release builds of Tessel include a copy of FFmpeg downloaded at `npm install`
from hash-pinned GPL static builds (see `scripts/ffmpeg-hashes.json`). The
bundled binary is an FFmpeg 7.1 build configured with GPL components (including
libx264).

After `npm install`, FFmpeg's license text is available at:

  vendor/ffmpeg/LICENSE

For general information about FFmpeg licensing, see:

  https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

Hugeicons
---------

UI icons in `app/icons/sprite.svg` and `app/index.html` are from the Hugeicons
free stroke set (`@hugeicons/core-free-icons`), MIT licensed. Regenerate with
`npm run vendor-icons`. See https://hugeicons.com/

